            "review_title": "Review at Com Tam Tuong Han",
            "review_text": "KristinCottam\nWinton, New Zealand46 contributions\n0\nCheap tasty food with super service\nAug 2019 • Family\nHad our last meal here tonight and our eldest declared it his best meal\nfor our month long trip of Vietnam. The meat was cooked just perfect and the broken rice was really good. Not 5 Star dining but fabulous value for money and we would all highly recommend\nThe freshly squeezed apple juice was a hit too.\nFour of us had mains and drinks all for 270k.... bargain!!\nRead more\nWritten August 31, 2019",
